#
#  HOW TO USE: Blender > Scripting tab > New > paste this whole file > Run Script.
#  - Deletes any previous "WonderWoman_BraceletClash" action first (no leftover keys), resets the
#    pose, sets FK mode, then builds a fresh action and makes it the active one.
#  - Only these bones are keyed: UpTorso, HEAD, FK arm/forearm/hand (L + R).
#    TORSO, legs, feet and root are NOT keyed, so Roblox walk/fly keeps the lower body.
#  - All curves BEZIER + AUTO_CLAMPED, no cycles modifier (one-shot).
#  - Running it twice is safe: you still get exactly one action.
#
#  Game: ONE track, playAnim(..., WW_ANIMS.BraceletClash, 0.06, 1) at cast start. Priority = Action.
#  0-8 bracelets snap up beside the face -> 8-22 charging: arms tremble on a 10-frame beat while the
#  core grows, chest presses forward -> 22-29 arms fling back, chest opens -> 29-33 forearms smash
#  forward together: CLASH 33 (= castTime 0.55, shockwave fires) -> recoil from the blast -> lower to rest by 64.
# =============================================================================
